 data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊗</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> in it.</p>","file":"ch15-tensors/06-tensor-algebra.html"}